# g85-fu-engine (desktop): nothing to paste into a hot file.
#
# host/browser/revision is served by host/browser-engine/snapshot.ts and listed in ENGINE_REQUEST_METHODS (index.ts), so it needs the
# protocol row of native/core/crates/mixdog-app-protocol/pending-rows/g85-fu-engine.rows and a regeneration of packages/protocol/src/index.ts
# and packages/protocol-client method table (PROTO-WIRE) before host/host-coverage.test.mjs can see the method in the protocol.
#
# registerSignIn now takes the snapshot port as its fourth argument (the observation the automatic sign-in flow asks for is a capture of
# the page); host/browser-engine/index.ts passes it, no other caller exists.
#
# The turn forget of an unloaded session is closed on the core side (native/core/crates/pending-wire/g85-fu-engine.wire item 2: the engine
# no longer sends host/browser/turn forget when a runtime stops, only when a session is closed or deleted), so the desktop keeps
# `turnFinishedAt` of an unloaded session as releaseSession did.
